<Slide style={{ background: "#0B1220", padding: "44px 72px", display: "flex", flexDirection: "column" }}>
  <Text style={{ color: "#6B7280", fontSize: 14, letterSpacing: 3 }}>一条链路</Text>
  <Text style={{ color: "#F7F4EC", fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 700, marginTop: 10 }}>「转给小王 100 元」走完七步</Text>

  <Box style={{ display: "flex", flexDirection: "row", gap: 40, marginTop: 28 }}>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, display: "flex", flexDirection: "column", gap: 15 }}>
      <Box style={{ display: "flex", flexDirection: "row", gap: 16, alignItems: "center", background: "rgba(34,197,94,0.08)", borderLeft: "3px solid #22C55E", padding: "16px 16px" }}>
        <Text style={{ color: "#22C55E", fontSize: 15, fontFamily: "Consolas, monospace", width: 28 }}>01</Text>
        <Text style={{ color: "#F7F4EC", fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 600, width: 96 }}>输入守卫</Text>
        <Text style={{ color: "#9CA3AF", fontSize: 15 }}>归一化，识别注入特征，命中即拦</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ display: "flex", flexDirection: "row", gap: 16, alignItems: "center", background: "rgba(34,197,94,0.08)", borderLeft: "3px solid #22C55E", padding: "16px 16px" }}>
        <Text style={{ color: "#22C55E", fontSize: 15, fontFamily: "Consolas, monospace", width: 28 }}>02</Text>
        <Text style={{ color: "#F7F4EC", fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 600, width: 96 }}>意图官</Text>
        <Text style={{ color: "#9CA3AF", fontSize: 15 }}>落到 transfer，payee 小王，金额 10000 分</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ display: "flex", flexDirection: "row", gap: 16, alignItems: "center", background: "rgba(245,158,11,0.08)", borderLeft: "3px solid #F59E0B", padding: "16px 16px" }}>
        <Text style={{ color: "#F59E0B", fontSize: 15, fontFamily: "Consolas, monospace", width: 28 }}>03</Text>
        <Text style={{ color: "#F7F4EC", fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 600, width: 96 }}>三评估并行</Text>
        <Text style={{ color: "#9CA3AF", fontSize: 15 }}>风控判黄，合规放行，体验无需追问</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ display: "flex", flexDirection: "row", gap: 16, alignItems: "center", background: "rgba(245,158,11,0.08)", borderLeft: "3px solid #F59E0B", padding: "16px 16px" }}>
        <Text style={{ color: "#F59E0B", fontSize: 15, fontFamily: "Consolas, monospace", width: 28 }}>04</Text>
        <Text style={{ color: "#F7F4EC", fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 600, width: 96 }}>仲裁官</Text>
        <Text style={{ color: "#9CA3AF", fontSize: 15 }}>绿绿黄取最高，判黄，需确认</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ display: "flex", flexDirection: "row", gap: 16, alignItems: "center", background: "rgba(245,158,11,0.08)", borderLeft: "3px solid #F59E0B", padding: "16px 16px" }}>
        <Text style={{ color: "#F59E0B", fontSize: 15, fontFamily: "Consolas, monospace", width: 28 }}>05</Text>
        <Text style={{ color: "#F7F4EC", fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 600, width: 96 }}>确认令牌</Text>
        <Text style={{ color: "#9CA3AF", fontSize: 15 }}>绑定会话、工具、参数摘要，120 秒有效</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ display: "flex", flexDirection: "row", gap: 16, alignItems: "center", background: "rgba(34,197,94,0.08)", borderLeft: "3px solid #22C55E", padding: "16px 16px" }}>
        <Text style={{ color: "#22C55E", fontSize: 15, fontFamily: "Consolas, monospace", width: 28 }}>06</Text>
        <Text style={{ color: "#F7F4EC", fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 600, width: 96 }}>执行官</Text>
        <Text style={{ color: "#9CA3AF", fontSize: 15 }}>重算摘要比对通过，扣账</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ display: "flex", flexDirection: "row", gap: 16, alignItems: "center", background: "rgba(34,197,94,0.08)", borderLeft: "3px solid #22C55E", padding: "16px 16px" }}>
        <Text style={{ color: "#22C55E", fontSize: 15, fontFamily: "Consolas, monospace", width: 28 }}>07</Text>
        <Text style={{ color: "#F7F4EC", fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 600, width: 96 }}>审计官</Text>
        <Text style={{ color: "#9CA3AF", fontSize: 15 }}>写链，序号递增，前序哈希串起来</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ color: "#6B7280", fontSize: 14, lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 4 }}>每一步的输入输出都写进审计记录，界面上可逐条展开核对。</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ width: 320, display: "flex", flexDirection: "column", gap: 14, background: "rgba(59,130,246,0.08)", border: "1px solid rgba(59,130,246,0.35)", borderRadius: 12, padding: 24, display: "flex", flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "flex-start" }}>
      <Text style={{ color: "#93C5FD", fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 700 }}>为什么拆成七步</Text>
      <Text style={{ color: "#9CA3AF", fontSize: 16, lineHeight: 1.8, marginTop: 12 }}>每一步都能单独测、单独改、单独讲。判错了看第七步之前的记录，改规则只动一个角色，不影响主流程。</Text>
      <Box style={{ display: "flex", flexDirection: "column", gap: 9, marginTop: 16 }}>
        <Text style={{ color: "#D1D5DB", fontSize: 15, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>前三步只看用户说了什么</Text>
        <Text style={{ color: "#D1D5DB", fontSize: 15, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>中间两步决定能不能办</Text>
        <Text style={{ color: "#D1D5DB", fontSize: 15, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>后两步保证办完能回看</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ color: "#6B7280", fontSize: 14, lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 16 }}>七步的结论全部写进审计，界面上可以逐条展开。</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
</Slide>
